      "writtenOn": "2016-11-17T11:20:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hung-Te: Any idea if mapping from keyboard matrix row/column to keycode is different on other layouts (say, a Japanese keyboard layout with more keys?). It\u0027s very clear that keycode to actual key depends on the layout (that\u0027s done in software), but I\u0027m wondering about matrix to keycode conversion.",
      "parentUuid": "70504049_1b26ff7d",
      "revId": "3a71bd233bb608e49f5e3b43401fdaf884a3ba06",
